#. Card 4 of 49 · narrative · 9.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:4
msgctxt "005"
msgid ""
"There is an old proverb\n"
"which says:\n"
"Don't try to do two things\n"
"at once and expect to do\n"
"justice to both."
msgstr ""

#. Card 5 of 49 · narrative · 20.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:5
msgctxt "006"
msgid ""
"This is the story of a boy\n"
"who tried it.  While\n"
"employed as a moving\n"
"picture operator in a\n"
"small town theater he\n"
"was also studying to be\n"
"a detective."
msgstr ""

#. Card 6 of 49 · insert · 2.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:6
msgctxt "008"
msgid ""
"How-to-be\n"
"a\n"
"detective"
msgstr ""

#. Card 7 of 49 · insert · 1.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:7
msgctxt "009"
msgid ""
"How-to-be\n"
"a\n"
"detective"
msgstr ""

#. Card 8 of 49 · dialogue · 7.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:8
msgctxt "011"
msgid ""
"\"Say — Mr. Detective — before you clean up any mysteries — clean up this "
"theater.\""
msgstr ""

#. Card 9 of 49 · credit · 7.0s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:9
msgctxt "012"
msgid ""
"The girl in the case.\n"
"—Kathryn McGuire"
msgstr ""

#. Card 10 of 49 · credit · 8.8s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:10
msgctxt "014"
msgid ""
"The girl's father had nothing to do so he got a hired man to help him.\n"
"—Joe Keaton\n"
"—Erwin Connelly"
msgstr ""

#. Card 11 of 49 · insert · 1.2s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/sherlock-jr-1924/cards.yaml:11
